      "body": "## Problem\n\n#41175 added a fused verify-commit path to `run_eagle_verify`. On CUDA, the non-idle path now always takes the fused branch — but the watermark `append_speculative` call from #37577 was left only in the non-fused branch. As a result, on main today:\n\n- the watermark context ring never advances past the prompt tail;\n- verify rows hash stale contexts;\n- **watermarked EAGLE/EAGLE3/NEXTN output is undetectable**.\n\n## Fix\n\nCall `append_speculative` on both branches so accepted tokens always enter the watermark history.\n\n## Evidence\n\nQwen3-8B, H200, 40 essay prompts × 512 tokens, temperature 1.0, top-p 0.95, detection with the in-tree detector:\n\n| Configuration | Requests with p < 1e-3 | Median per-request z | Accept length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| No speculation | 40/40 | 8.09 | — |\n| EAGLE3 3/1/4, before this fix | **0/40** | **0.66** | 2.250 |\n| EAGLE3 3/1/4, with this fix | 40/40 | 7.95 | 2.261 |\n| EAGLE3 tree 5/8/32, with this fix | 40/40 | 8.23 | 3.719 |\n\nUnwatermarked control arms: 0–1 of 40 requests at p < 1e-3, median z 0.09–0.55. Accept length is unchanged by the fix (ON 2.261 vs OFF 2.238).\n\nCUDA watermark selector/state suites: 22 passed. Endpoint e2e `test_watermark.py`: 5 passed. Detection ON/OFF control also verified with watermark enabled at the server but disabled per request.\n\nNo committed regression test: a meaningful guard needs an EAGLE-capable serve, and the endpoint e2e's Qwen2.5-0.5B has no draft model — happy to add one if reviewers want a specific harness for it.\n\nFound while building DSPARK watermark support (follow-up PR).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38999500915](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38999500915)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38999500868](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38999500868)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38999500909](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38999500909)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
